= Civic Labor League

The Civic Labor League is a Municipal Party fielding candidates in Regina[? if cll_expanded = 1 : and Saskatoon?]. It is formed by a coalition of Social Democrats and Communists, unified by a support for urban Labour. 

[? if cll_in_government = 1 : Currently, the CLL is in government and we can use our ties with them to advance our policy goals. ?]

[? if cll_in_government = 0 : The CLL is out of government right now, unfortunately. We may send aid their way to improve their electoral success. ?]

